   "subject": "priors for bernoulli model",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi Paul,</div><div> I&#39;ve been using default priors for my current models. The default is a student_T(3, 0, 10) on the intercept.</div><div><br></div><div> However, I was wondering if I should provide more informative priors. The &quot;prior&quot; information for the disease I&#39;m studying is that it has a prevalence of 0.001 to 0.003 depending on the studied population. In my dataset the prevalence is about 10 times higher, but still, it&#39;s only around 0.02 to 0.05.</div><div><br></div><div> So it seems I could constrain the model to a more realistic prior probability range - for instance a prior prevalence between 0 and 0.05 or 0 and 0.1 would be more realistic than 0 to 1.</div><div><br></div><div> It may not matter since I have a lot of observations (nearly 20,000), but it&#39;s probably at least worth testing. How would you recommend changing the prior to account for this more realistic prior information?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Paul</div><div><br></div><div>Here&#39;s an example of a model with a few covariates -</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Family: bernoulli(logit) </span></font></span></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Formula: Result ~ s(long, lat) + race + CMV_neg + CMV_pos </span></font></span></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"> </span></font></span></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"blue\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">&gt; prior_summary(Model5)</span></font></span></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">                prior     class         coef group nlpar bound resp dpar</span></font></span></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">1                             b                                         </span></font></span></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">2                             b      CMV_neg                            </span></font></span></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">3                             b      CMV_pos                            </span></font></span></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">4                             b RaceMinority                            </span></font></span></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">5                             b   slonglat_1                            </span></font></span></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">6                             b   slonglat_2                            </span></font></span></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">7                     Intercept                                         </span></font></span></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">8 student_t(3, 0, 10)       sds                                         </span></font></span></font></div><div style=\"margin:0px;background-color:white\"><font face=\"Calibri,sans-serif\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;background-color:white\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Lucida Console\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-family:Lucida Console,serif,&quot;EmojiFont&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">9                           sds  s(long,lat)     </span></font></span></font></div></div></div>"
